# modules-trim.config - kernel fragment generated for the lean MP257F-DK FFT image.
#
# Disables every module the stock defconfig builds (=m) that this board never
# loads. The 39 modules that DO load at runtime (captured via lsmod on the booted
# board) are left =m by the defconfig and intentionally NOT listed here.
